<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-ACIL raises Ibstock stake.</title>
<headline>RTRS-ACIL raises Ibstock stake.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brierley Investments Ltd's Australian Consolidated Investments Ltd (ACIL) said on Monday it had raised its holding in British building materials and forest products group Ibstock Plc to 23.05 percent.</p>
<p>ACIL said on October 25 it had increased the stake to 22.05 percent. ACIL is 96.1 percent owned by Brierley.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 373-1800</p>
</text>
